flowchart TB
  RAW[RAW_BYTES]
  SIGN[SIGNING_KEY_VERIFICATION]
  INST[VERIFIED_INSTALLATION]

  RAW -->|fixed endpoint / installation\nno body trust| SIGN
  SIGN -->|unknown, revoked, disabled, invalid,\nor cutover-ineligible key context| SIG_REJECT[SIGNATURE_REJECTED]
  SIGN -->|eligible signing key\nverifies raw bytes| INST
  INST -->|envelope/schema cannot parse| MALFORMED[MALFORMED_REJECTED]
  INST -->|adapter/schema not allowlisted| UNSUPPORTED[UNSUPPORTED_VERSION_QUARANTINED]

  subgraph boundaryA[Boundary A — ingress reservation, deduplication, and routing]
    RESERVE[RECEIPT_RESERVED\nstable event identity locked\ndelivery attempt appended]
    BIND[BINDING_RESOLUTION\nresolve and pin historical binding]
    REPLAY[REPLAY_RECORDED]
    CONFLICT[IDENTITY_CONFLICT]
    RETRY_AMBIG[RETRY_AMBIGUOUS_RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED]
    UNKNOWN[UNKNOWN_BINDING_QUARANTINED]
    AMBIG[AMBIGUOUS_BINDING_QUARANTINED]
    ROUTED[ROUTED_TO_REVIEW]
  end

  INST -->|eligible authenticated envelope| RESERVE
  RESERVE -->|same identity + verified digest| REPLAY
  RESERVE -->|same identity + different verified digest| CONFLICT
  RESERVE -->|durable prior outcome cannot be proven| RETRY_AMBIG
  RESERVE -->|new identity| BIND
  BIND -->|no unique historical binding| UNKNOWN
  BIND -->|multiple bindings or unprovable cutover| AMBIG
  BIND -->|new eligible resolved occurrence| ROUTED

  ACK[Adapter response gate\nonly after the applicable durable outcome commits\n2xx only where provider policy permits\nnever CRM creation]
  REPLAY --> ACK
  CONFLICT --> ACK
  RETRY_AMBIG --> ACK
  UNSUPPORTED --> ACK
  UNKNOWN --> ACK
  AMBIG --> ACK
  ROUTED --> ACK

  PRENOTE[Pre-tenant signing purpose only:\nserver-recorded current or approved-overlap signing generations.\nNever resolve API/data credentials, enumerate tenant keys,\nor confer school authority.]
  SIGN -. applies .-> PRENOTE

  ORDERNOTE[Reservation is a Boundary A annotation, not a lifecycle enum:\n1 reserve + append delivery; 2 classify replay/conflict;\n3 only new identity resolves/pins historical binding;\n4 commit applicable durable outcome before response.]
  RESERVE -. required order .-> ORDERNOTE

  POSTNOTE[A later separately approved provider/data operation needs a distinct credential\nand a current verified school connection, exact asset grant/capability,\nauthorization, purpose, and lifecycle check.]
  BIND -. separate future operation .-> POSTNOTE

  UNKNOWNNOTE[No school queue or candidate unless independent stored evidence proves one school.\nDefault without approved operator plane: reject.]
  UNKNOWN -. boundary .-> UNKNOWNNOTE
  AMBIGNOTE[Never route by current mapping, label, externalId, default account, or selector.]
  AMBIG -. boundary .-> AMBIGNOTE

  classDef receipt fill:#eaf7ff,stroke:#126782,color:#082a39
  classDef reject fill:#fff0f1,stroke:#a51c30,color:#4a0610
  classDef durable fill:#eefbf4,stroke:#197345,color:#092b18
  classDef note fill:#fff9e8,stroke:#886500,color:#332600
  class RAW,SIGN,INST,RESERVE,BIND receipt
  class SIG_REJECT,MALFORMED,UNSUPPORTED,UNKNOWN,AMBIG,RETRY_AMBIG,CONFLICT reject
  class REPLAY,ROUTED,ACK durable
  class PRENOTE,ORDERNOTE,POSTNOTE,UNKNOWNNOTE,AMBIGNOTE note
